The Verus-relevant command-line argument --features can't follow the Verus-irrelevant argument --lib because that will cause the Verus-relevant argument to be ignored. To fix this, place Verus-relevant cargo options (like --package, --features, --manifest-path) before any Verus-irrelevant ones.
Args forwarded to Cargo must precede args forwarded to Verus
Error: Args forwarded to Cargo must precede args forwarded to Verus
EXIT=1 SECONDS=0
